{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30614","headline":"风不鸣条 · 金厚载","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂曙风生，迟迟散野轻。\n露华摇有滴，林叶褭无声。\n暗翦藂芳发，空传谷鸟鸣。\n悠扬韶景静，澹荡霁烟横。\n远水波澜息，荒郊草树荣。\n吾君垂至化，万类共澄清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金厚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}